ease randomly output one of \"[[A]]\", \"[[B]]\", \"[[C]]\", or \"[[D]]\";\n(3) Please only output the most likely answer index based on the given information, and do not output any other content.\n\n[Story]\nZhang Hao's good friend Yang Li shows him a short story she writes in her writing table, hoping to get his opinion. Yang Li's novel lacks appeal, and the story plot is also quite bland. When she asks Zhang Hao for his opinion, Zhang Hao praises her novel for its creativity and encourages her to keep trying.\n\n[Question]\nWhy does Zhang Hao say this?\n\n[Candidate Answers]\nA. Zhang Hao says this because he maintains a friendly relationship with Yang Li out of politeness, avoiding direct criticism that hurts feelings.\nB. Zhang Hao does not have much insight into literary creation, he says this just to casually deal with Yang Li's question.\nC. Zhang Hao is participating in the same competition, he says this to avoid forming a competitive relationship with Yang Li in the competition.\nD. Zhang Hao says this because he truly thinks Yang Li's novel is very creative and greatly appreciates her writing talent.","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.0017006863810538758,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af52b96c2ddb05a7fe30b60","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794452374309,"createTime":"2026-11-12 10:59:34","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"c21a7356585a48a7b9b0ea3d34317a29"}